## Stylized Volumetric Cloud Formation Test

Date: 2026-06-21

- Tested stylized volumetric cloud Formation Texture variants in
  `/Game/Cubeless/SKY/Test_UnusedUDS_V4` using viewport bookmark 5 as the
  comparison camera.
- Rejected pure procedural V12 formation variants because they lost the UDS
  visible-cloud sampling distribution and rendered mostly empty sky at the
  bookmark.
- Compared UDS original, prior V10/V11 candidates, UDS-blended V13 candidates,
  and V10B shift/max V14 candidates with the SkyDome hidden so static skybox
  clouds were not counted.
- Selected V14B as the current stylized volumetric Formation Texture because it
  preserves V10B's round puffy clusters while adding a small amount of coverage
  without reintroducing the broad UDS sheet shape.
- Final material instance:
  `/Game/Cubeless/SKY/V4/Materials/MI_Cubeless_UDSVolumetricCloud_V4_ShapeRef10B_UDSConservativeRefCumulus`
- Final Formation Texture:
  `/Game/Cubeless/SKY/V4/Textures/StylizedShapeRef14_V10ShiftPuffyFormation/VT_Cubeless_V4_ShapeRef14B_V10ShiftPuffyFormation_FormationVolume`
- UDS-owned cell/profile/turbulence replacements remain on the V4-owned
  Cubeless assets:
  `3D_Cells_32_V4`, `3D_Cells_64_V4`, `3DCells_128_V4`,
  `Cloud_Profile_V4`, and `CloudsTurbulence_V4`.
- Verification:
  - `M_Cubeless_UDSVolumetricCloud_V4_Reassembled` compiled with
    `compile_error_count=0`.
  - `Cubeless_V4_SkyDome` temporary viewport hiding was restored to visible.
  - Dirty package count after final save: `0`.
